Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:04.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ostapenko packs a power punch in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科在武汉\N打出强劲一击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:12.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A dazzling attacking performance from one of the biggest hitters in the game, as she picks Pegula apart.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N网坛火力最猛的球员之一\N用耀眼的进攻拆解佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.10,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The second seed is stunned.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二号种子被震住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:20.72,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She missed three match points in the second set, and they proved so costly.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘错失三个赛点\N让她付出了沉重代价
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:24.49,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}日 武汉第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:27.90,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}奥斯塔彭科迎战{\fs78}2{\fs68}号种子佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:31.06,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 比赛远未结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.16,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First serve, set point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一发 盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:42.76,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Set point gobbled up by Jess Pegula.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N佩古拉轻松拿下盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:48.66,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Frustration for Jelena Ostapenko, who hasn't quite hit the heights in the opening set here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科很懊恼\N首盘没打出应有水准
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.10,0:00:55.36,TL,,0,0,550,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Seamless from the American, the world number four in business here, six-two in just over half an hour.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N美国选手打得行云流水\N世界第四掌控局面\N半小时出头六比二拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:59.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So it's a big task facing Ostapenko here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科面临艰巨任务
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:03.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘 奥斯塔彭科两次落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:04.67,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}都立即追平
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:07.61,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她用反手直线穿越上网对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.61,0:01:10.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}比赛进入抢七 险境接连出现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:21.50,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There's another example, though, of her firepower.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这又一次展示了她的火力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:35.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Pegula did well to jam the return back, but she was always on the back foot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N佩古拉把接发球挡回去了\N但她始终处在被动之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.66,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Found the gap. Good pass from Ostapenko.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N找到空当\N奥斯塔彭科漂亮的穿越
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:50.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}抢七 从{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:52.59,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}对手拿到两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:55.81,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}奥斯塔彭科连救两分 追到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:58.40,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} 第三个赛点！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:18.16,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is unreal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.83,0:02:23.74,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第三个赛点 她也成功化解
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:26.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}随后 奥斯塔彭科连拿两分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:28.46,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}9{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}扳平盘分！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:41.02,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Incredible. Absolutely incredible. And on we go in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不可思议 实在不可思议\N武汉这场比赛还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:44.59,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}决胜盘 奥斯塔彭科{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:46.95,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}佩古拉又追成{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:48.56,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}奥斯塔彭科马上回应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:50.47,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}在接发球时连拿四分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:52.91,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第一个赛点就结束比赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:04.72,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ostapenko packs a power punch in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科在武汉\N打出强劲一击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:12.32,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A dazzling attacking performance from one of the biggest hitters in the game, as she picks Pegula apart.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N网坛火力最猛的球员之一\N用耀眼的进攻拆解佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:15.12,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The second seed is stunned.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二号种子被震住了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:20.74,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She missed three match points in the second set, and they proved so costly.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘错失三个赛点\N让她付出了沉重代价
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:27.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ostapenko: too powerful, too potent, too good.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科力量太强\N威力太猛 打得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:34.58,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And into the round of 16 from a set down: two-six, seven-six, six-three.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N先丢一盘后逆转进十六强\N二比六 七比六 六比三
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:35.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a performance.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么精彩的表现！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.99,0:03:39.08,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}全场 奥斯塔彭科{\fs78}45{\fs68}记制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:40.74,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}佩古拉{\fs78}15{\fs68}记
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:41.88,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:44.77,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她也有{\fs78}37{\fs68}次 对手{\fs78}12{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:48.37,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这场胜利 靠进攻 靠关键分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:53.72,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}奥斯塔彭科晋级武汉第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:56.54,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点 都没能终结她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:59.67,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}下一场 她能再进一步吗？
